      "question_text": "設平面向量 $\textbf{a} = (3, 1)$、$\textbf{b} = (2, 4)$，求兩向量的夾角 $\theta$。",
      "answer_text": "$\\cos \\theta = \\frac{\\textbf{a} \\cdot \\textbf{b}}{\\left|\\textbf{a}\\right|\\left|\\textbf{b}\\right|} = \\frac{3 \\times 2 + 1 \\times 4}{\\sqrt{3^2 + 1^2} \\times \\sqrt{2^2 + 4^2}} = \\frac{6 + 4}{\\sqrt{10} \\times \\sqrt{20}} = \\frac{10}{\\sqrt{200}} = \\frac{10}{10\\sqrt{2}} = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}$，故 $\\theta = 45^\\circ$。",
